==[[Istan]]==
Quests in this region are only available to [[Elonian]] ([[Nightfall]]) characters, except for [[All for One and One for Justice]], [[Chasing Zenmai]], [[Command Training]], [[Hole of Istan]], [[Student Jin]], [[Student Sousuke]], [[The Council is Called]], [[The Time is Nigh]], [[The Toy's Story]], and [[Zaishen Elite (quest)]]. The quests, [[A Land of Heroes]], [[Battle Preparations]], and [[Securing Champion's Dawn]] are only available to [[Tyria]]n ([[Prophecies]]) and [[Canthan]] ([[Factions]]) characters.
